flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Initialize YoloObjectRepresentationModel]
    B --> C[Setup YOLO model]
    C --> D[Run model]
    D --> E[Preprocess input]
    E --> F[Process input]
    F --> G[Postprocess results]
    G --> H{Boxes with tracks?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Extract boxes, ids, labels]
    I --> J[Update track_history]
    J --> K[Create ObjectCoordData list]
    K --> L[Return list of objects]
    H -- No --> M[Return empty list]
    G --> N[Optionally show detection]
    M --> P[End]
    L --> P